QQBot-EX
========

QQBot-EX is a fork of @tencent-connect/dsh-qqbot 0.5.2:

  https://github.com/tencent-connect/dsh-qqbot
  Copyright (c) 2026 Tencent Connect
  Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE).

QQBot-EX keeps the upstream plugin's MIT license. The following changes are
released under the same license:

  - configurable workspace for new QQ conversations (`workspace` config);
  - explicit `workspace.attachSession()` after creating/resuming a session;
  - automatic new session when the configured workspace differs from the
    session header's cwd;
  - `DSH_PROFILE_DIR` fallback in `getProfileDir()` for linked/local installs;
  - settings-page field and documentation for the workspace option.

